 "html": "<section class=\"section_sv-hood\" id=\"hood\" data-frame=\"under-the-hood\" aria-labelledby=\"hood-h\"><span class=\"ab_frame-label\" data-frame-label=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▢ under-the-hood</span><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-medium\"><div class=\"ab_sv_code\"><div class=\"ab_sv_code_copy\"><div class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">/engineer · under the hood</div><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2 is-hood\" id=\"hood-h\" data-split=\"\">Under the <span class=\"t-outline\">hood</span></h2><p class=\"ab_sec-h_lede text-size-lede\">A peek at the kind of code behind this service. Short, readable and written so the next developer can follow it.</p></div><div class=\"ab_sv_code_slot\" id=\"svCode\"></div></div><div class=\"ab_cms-source\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p data-field=\"code-label\">Code label</p><p data-field=\"code\">code</p></div></div></div></div></section>",
